# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "We explore various types of quantum noise and errors, what causes them, and how to model them."
msgstr "Nous explorons différents types de bruit et d'erreurs quantiques, leurs causes, et comment les modéliser."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Noise and errors"
msgstr "Bruit et erreurs"

#. type: Plain text
